## 🚀 TEST NGAY

### 1. Login
```
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@test.com",
  "password": "123456"
}
```

### 2. Get Movies
```
GET http://localhost:5000/api/customer/movies?page=1&pageSize=10
```

### 3. Get Showtimes
```
GET http://localhost:5000/api/customer/showtimes/1
```

### 4. Create Booking (need login)
```
POST http://localhost:5000/api/customer/create-booking
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Cookie

{
  "customer_id": 1,
  "showtime_id": 1,
  "seat_ids": [1, 2, 3],
  "food_items": []
}
```

### 5. Verify Ticket (Staff)
```
POST http://localhost:5000/api/staff/verify-ticket
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "qr_code": "abc-xyz-123"
}
```

